reliability_scoring.py is vendored from estorides 1.3.4
(https://pypi.org/project/estorides/), module estorides_core.reliability_scoring.

The file is unmodified. It is self-contained (stdlib only) and provides
the NATO Admiralty confidence model (source reliability A-F x credibility 1-6,
extended with source-type hierarchy, corroboration, and freshness decay)
that OSI uses to score edges.

